摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"针对 DeepSeek V4‑Flash / V4‑Pro 高峰涨价时段的成本管控 Agent 插件。高峰时段自动弹窗提醒计费上涨，支持立即执行 / 定时调度，定时面板自动屏蔽高价时段，自动过滤已过期时间，到达预约时间自动重放用户指令，规避跨时段涨价损耗。","id":"gh:1336103818","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"OffPeak","slug":"christophersmith2737-commits/OffPeak","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"针对 DeepSeek V4‑Flash / V4‑Pro 高峰涨价时段的成本管控 Agent 插件。高峰时段自动弹窗提醒计费上涨，支持立即执行 / 定时调度，定时面板自动屏蔽高价时段，自动过滤已过期"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"时间，到达预约时间自动重放用户指令，规避跨时段涨价损耗。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# OffPeak · dsh-offpeak"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Peak-hour price guard for DeepSeek API tidal pricing**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Intercept your message before it's sent during peak hours — schedule it to run when it's cheaper."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"*Read this in 中文*"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DeepSeek moved to **peak/off-peak (tidal) API pricing** effective **2026-08-17** (Beijing time):"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Period | Hours (Beijing) | Output price vs. before |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **Peak** | 09:00–12:00, 14:00–18:00 | up to **4.5×** |\n| **Off-peak** | everything else | **half o"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" | 09:00–12:00, 14:00–18:00 | up to **4.5×** |\n| **Off-peak** | everything else | **half of peak** |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"New per-million-token rates (¥):"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Model | Item | Peak | Off-peak |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **V4 Flash** | input (cache miss) | 3 | 1.5 |\n| | output | 9 | 4.5 |\n| | input (cache hit) | 0.1 |"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" 0.05 |\n| **V4 Pro** | input (cache miss) | 9 | 4.5 |\n| | output | 27 | 13.5 |\n| | input (cache hit)"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"Pro** | input (cache miss) | 9 | 4.5 |\n| | output | 27 | 13.5 |\n| | input (cache hit) | 0.3 | 0.15 |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"If you mostly run long tasks with DeepSeek V4 Flash, sending them at 10:00 costs **3× more** than se"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nding them at 19:00. OffPeak makes sure you *notice* that before you press send — not after."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"While your current model is DeepSeek V4 Flash / Pro and the Beijing clock is inside a peak window, p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ressing **Enter** (or clicking send) in the composer **intercepts the message before it is sent**. T"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"he text stays in the input box and a dialog appears:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Current price card** — peak vs. off-peak per-million-token rates for the model in use\n- **Contin"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ue** — sends the message now, through the normal composer path (draft clearing, queue, notices all i"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ntact)\n- **Schedule** — opens a time wheel with **only off-peak hours (0–8, 18–23)**; past times are"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" removed, and after 23:00 the wheel rolls into the next day's 0–8; minutes run **00–59**. The comman"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"d text and time are recorded, and the local server **automatically submits the command to the origin"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"al session when the time arrives** — no browser needed at that moment\n- **Don't remind me today** — "},{"id":"p16s7","text":"no more popups until the next Beijing midnight\n- **✕** — close without sending; the draft stays in t"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ps until the next Beijing midnight\n- **✕** — close without sending; the draft stays in the input box"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> Running commands are **never interrupted**: if a task crosses into a peak window mid-execution, no"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"thing pops up — the reminder appears on your *next* command inside peak hours."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Requires the **web profile** (`dsh web`)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Manual install** (no pnpm needed):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Copy the package into the shared plugin directory:\n- Windows: `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh\\profiles\\node_m"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"odules\\dsh-offpeak`\n- macOS / Linux: `~/.dsh/profiles/node_modules/dsh-offpeak`\n2. Append to `$DSH_H"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"OME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"3. Restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> The plugin is **dormant before `effectiveFrom`** (2026-08-17 — the day tidal pricing starts). Set "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"it to today's date to try it out sooner."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The interception is **client-side**: a capture-phase listener watches Enter on the composer textar"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ea and clicks on the send button, checking a locally-computed Beijing clock plus the latest server s"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"tate (peak windows, model, \"don't remind today\").\n- **IME-safe**: Enter during Chinese/Japanese comp"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"osition (`isComposing`) is never intercepted.\n- **Server-side fallback**: if a message reaches the h"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ost through a non-intercepted path during peak, the session-event listener raises a non-blocking rem"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"inder instead.\n- Peak/off-peak judgment uses `Asia/Shanghai` wall-clock time regardless of the machi"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"\n- Peak/off-peak judgment uses `Asia/Shanghai` wall-clock time regardless of the machine's timezone."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `effectiveFrom` | `\"2026-08-17\"` | Tidal-pricing start date (Beijing); plugin is dormant before it"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" |\n| `debug` | `false` | Bypass `effectiveFrom`; enables `/ds-offpeak/debug-remind` |\n| `peakWindows"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"` | `09:00–12:00, 14:00–18:00` | Peak windows in minutes (`{ start, end }`), overridable |\n| `profil"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"e` | auto (`web`) | Profile that owns the state file |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Routes"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Method | Path | Purpose |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| GET | `/ds-offpeak/state` | Status: peak? model, price table, pending reminder, wheel options, tas"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ks |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/ack` | Acknowledge a fallback reminder |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/dismiss` |"},{"id":"p34s3","text":" Don't remind today |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/schedule` | `{ text, atMs, sessionId }` — record a sched"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"uled execution |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/cancel` | `{ id }` — cancel a task |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/ex"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"ecute` | `{ id }` — run a task immediately |\n| POST | `/ds-offpeak/debug-remind` | Simulate a peak c"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"ommand (debug only) |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"All writes accept **same-origin POSTs only**. State and tasks persist in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profil"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" **same-origin POSTs only**. State and tasks persist in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>/offpeak.json`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Security & privacy"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Interception happens **locally in the browser**; a message is never sent anywhere except through t"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"he normal composer path when you choose Continue.\n- Scheduled commands are stored **locally** and re"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"-submitted to the **same session** by the local server.\n- Prices are hardcoded from the official ann"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ouncement; **no network calls, no telemetry**."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Why does the hour wheel skip 12–14?** 12:00–14:00 is technically off-peak, but it sits between the"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" two peak windows. OffPeak plays it safe and only offers clearly-safe hours (0–8, 18–23)."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**Does it block subagent / queued messages?** No — only the composer's own send gesture is intercept"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"oes it block subagent / queued messages?** No — only the composer's own send gesture is intercepted."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**What if I close the dialog?** Nothing is sent; the draft stays in the input box."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Multiple tabs?** Each tab intercepts independently; \"don't remind today\" is server-side and shared"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"*Multiple tabs?** Each tab intercepts independently; \"don't remind today\" is server-side and shared."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
